            <div id="admin-product-guide-accordion" class="admin-product-guide-accordion">
                <div class="admin-product-guide-header" onclick="toggleProductGuideAccordion()" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="admin-product-guide-content" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();toggleProductGuideAccordion();}">
                    <div class="admin-product-guide-header-text">
                        <i class="fa fa-book" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>Quick guide — when to use Rotate vs Look Around</span>
                    </div>
                    <i id="admin-product-guide-icon" class="fa fa-chevron-down admin-product-guide-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </div>
                <div id="admin-product-guide-content" class="admin-product-guide-content" style="display:none;">
                <div class="admin-guide-body">
                    <p class="admin-guide-lead">New here? Open each section below. Only <strong>name + price</strong> are required to save — everything else is optional.</p>

                    <div id="admin-guide-section-accord-media-types" class="admin-guide-section-accordion">
                        <div class="admin-guide-section-header" onclick="toggleAdminGuideSection('media-types')" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="admin-guide-section-media-types" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();toggleAdminGuideSection('media-types');}">
                            <span><i class="fa fa-th-large"></i> What each media type does on the shop</span>
                            <i id="admin-guide-section-icon-media-types" class="fa fa-chevron-down admin-guide-section-chevron"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div id="admin-guide-section-media-types" class="admin-guide-section-content" style="display:none;">
                            <div class="admin-guide-matrix">
                                <div class="admin-guide-matrix-row admin-guide-matrix-row--head">
                                    <span>Type</span><span>You upload</span><span>Customer taps</span><span>Scope</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="admin-guide-matrix-row">
                                    <span class="admin-guide-tag">Gallery</span>
                                    <span>Regular product photos</span>
                                    <span>Swipe in carousel</span>
                                    <span>Main or variant</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="admin-guide-matrix-row">
                                    <span class="admin-guide-tag admin-guide-tag--green">Swatch</span>
                                    <span>Small color/pattern thumb</span>
                                    <span>On size/color chip</span>
                                    <span>Variant only</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="admin-guide-matrix-row">
                                    <span class="admin-guide-tag admin-guide-tag--gold">Rotation frames</span>
                                    <span>12–72 stills (or extract from video)</span>
                                    <span><strong>Rotate</strong> — spin the item</span>
                                    <span>Main or variant</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="admin-guide-matrix-row">
                                    <span class="admin-guide-tag admin-guide-tag--blue">Video</span>
                                    <span>MP4 / MOV clip</span>
                                    <span><strong>Video</strong> — plays clip</span>
                                    <span>Main or variant</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="admin-guide-matrix-row">
                                    <span class="admin-guide-tag admin-guide-tag--blue">Panorama</span>
                                    <span>One 2:1 equirectangular image</span>
                                    <span><strong>Look Around</strong> — drag like Street View</span>
                                    <span>Main or variant</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="admin-guide-note">Badges: <span class="admin-media-scope admin-media-scope--global">🌐 All variants</span> = default for every combo · <span class="admin-media-scope admin-media-scope--variant">🎯 This variant</span> = overrides when customer picks that combo. Tap 👁 or ▶ to preview before saving.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="admin-guide-section-accord-extract-frames" class="admin-guide-section-accordion admin-guide-section-accordion--highlight">
                        <div class="admin-guide-section-header" onclick="toggleAdminGuideSection('extract-frames')" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="admin-guide-section-extract-frames" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();toggleAdminGuideSection('extract-frames');}">
                            <span><i class="fa fa-refresh"></i> When to use <strong>Extract frames</strong> → Rotate button</span>
                            <i id="admin-guide-section-icon-extract-frames" class="fa fa-chevron-down admin-guide-section-chevron"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div id="admin-guide-section-extract-frames" class="admin-guide-section-content" style="display:none;">
                            <p class="admin-guide-when"><strong>Use when:</strong> You have a <strong>normal flat product video</strong> (person holding item, tabletop spin, model walk) and want shoppers to <strong>swipe to turn the product</strong> like a 360° product spin.</p>
                            <p class="admin-guide-why"><strong>Why:</strong> Extract frames pulls 16 (or Auto/Custom) still images from your video into <strong>rotation frames</strong>. On the shop this powers the <strong>Rotate</strong> button — not video playback, not Street View.</p>
                            <p class="admin-guide-how"><strong>How:</strong> Upload video (always visible on the form) → on the video card open <strong>Create rotation frames from video</strong> → pick <strong>16 frames</strong> (default), <strong>Auto</strong>, or <strong>Custom</strong> → enable <strong>Rotate Product</strong> under Additional 360° → expand <strong>Rotation frames</strong> accordion to review thumbs → Save.</p>
                            <p class="admin-guide-example"><strong>Example:</strong> 15-second clip of a handbag on a turntable → extract 16 frames → customer swipes to see all sides of the bag.</p>
                            <p class="admin-guide-caution"><strong>Do not use for:</strong> Room tours, shop interiors, or “look around the scene” — that is <strong>panorama / Look Around</strong>, not rotation frames.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="admin-guide-section-accord-panorama" class="admin-guide-section-accordion admin-guide-section-accordion--highlight">
                        <div class="admin-guide-section-header" onclick="toggleAdminGuideSection('panorama')" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="admin-guide-section-panorama" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();toggleAdminGuideSection('panorama');}">
                            <span><i class="fa fa-street-view"></i> When to use <strong>Panorama</strong> → Look Around (Street View)</span>
                            <i id="admin-guide-section-icon-panorama" class="fa fa-chevron-down admin-guide-section-chevron"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div id="admin-guide-section-panorama" class="admin-guide-section-content" style="display:none;">
                            <p class="admin-guide-when"><strong>Use when:</strong> You want a <strong>Google Street View–style experience</strong> — shoppers <strong>drag to look around a 360° scene</strong> (room, boutique interior, styled setup, outdoor space).</p>
                            <p class="admin-guide-why"><strong>Why:</strong> Panorama is one wide <strong>2:1 equirectangular</strong> image. It immerses customers in the <strong>environment</strong>, not a product spin. On the shop they tap <strong>Look Around</strong> and drag left/right/up/down.</p>
                            <p class="admin-guide-how"><strong>How:</strong> Under <strong>Additional 360°</strong> → enable <strong>Look Around (panorama)</strong> → upload a 2:1 panorama photo <em>or</em> from a <strong>360° equirectangular video</strong> use <strong>Extract panorama for Look Around</strong> on the video card (flat video cannot be converted).</p>
                            <p class="admin-guide-example"><strong>Example:</strong> 360° photo of your store’s fitting room → customer drags to see mirrors, racks, and lighting — like walking through on Google Maps Street View.</p>
                            <p class="admin-guide-caution"><strong>Do not use for:</strong> Spinning a single SKU with swipe stills — use <strong>Extract frames</strong> and <strong>Rotate</strong> instead. Panorama ≠ product rotation ≠ flat video play.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="admin-guide-section-accord-video" class="admin-guide-section-accordion">
                        <div class="admin-guide-section-header" onclick="toggleAdminGuideSection('video')" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="admin-guide-section-video" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();toggleAdminGuideSection('video');}">
                            <span><i class="fa fa-video"></i> Video uploads</span>
                            <i id="admin-guide-section-icon-video" class="fa fa-chevron-down admin-guide-section-chevron"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div id="admin-guide-section-video" class="admin-guide-section-content" style="display:none;">
                            <p>Video sits <strong>outside</strong> the 360° accordion — always easy to find. Upload → preview the clip on the card.</p>
                            <p>Same 2:1 equirectangular video can feed <strong>Extract panorama</strong> (Look Around) <em>and</em> <strong>Extract frames</strong> (Rotate). Flat video only supports rotation frames. The clip itself still plays via the <strong>Video</strong> button on the shop.</p>
                            <p>Immersive <strong>360° video playback</strong> (customer inside the sphere) only works for true 2:1 equirectangular files — otherwise it plays as flat video.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="admin-guide-section-accord-360-panel" class="admin-guide-section-accordion">
                        <div class="admin-guide-section-header" onclick="toggleAdminGuideSection('360-panel')" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="admin-guide-section-360-panel" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();toggleAdminGuideSection('360-panel');}">
                            <span><i class="fa fa-cube"></i> Additional 360° panel (Rotate &amp; panorama)</span>
                            <i id="admin-guide-section-icon-360-panel" class="fa fa-chevron-down admin-guide-section-chevron"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div id="admin-guide-section-360-panel" class="admin-guide-section-content" style="display:none;">
                            <p>Optional — collapse when you do not need it. Contains two separate features:</p>
                            <ul class="admin-guide-list">
                                <li><strong>Rotate Product</strong> — checkbox + <strong>Rotation frames</strong> nested accordion (thumbs hidden until you expand).</li>
                                <li><strong>Look Around (panorama)</strong> — checkbox + upload or extract from 360° video.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>Drag thumbs to reorder · 👁 previews work on saved Cloudinary images too.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="admin-guide-section-accord-variants" class="admin-guide-section-accordion">
                        <div class="admin-guide-section-header" onclick="toggleAdminGuideSection('variants')" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="admin-guide-section-variants" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();toggleAdminGuideSection('variants');}">
                            <span><i class="fa fa-layer-group"></i> Variants, gallery &amp; stock</span>
                            <i id="admin-guide-section-icon-variants" class="fa fa-chevron-down admin-guide-section-chevron"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div id="admin-guide-section-variants" class="admin-guide-section-content" style="display:none;">
                            <p><strong>Variants:</strong> Each block = one sellable line. Comma-separate Size, Color, or Pattern (e.g. S,M × Red,Blue = 4 SKUs). Price, photos, video, 360° and stock follow the selected combo.</p>
                            <p><strong>Main gallery:</strong> Product-wide photos for home + detail. Variant gallery overrides when set; else mains fill in at start or end.</p>
                            <p><strong>Stock (most specific wins):</strong></p>
                            <ul class="admin-guide-list">
                                <li><strong>Level 1 · Global</strong> — one qty for whole product</li>
                                <li><strong>Level 2 · Variant block</strong> — per variant row</li>
                                <li><strong>Level 3 · Per combo</strong> — per size/color/pattern line</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>Red ⓘ on variant = fix stock/price before save. Blue ⓘ = duplicate combo merges on save.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="admin-guide-section-accord-admin-tools" class="admin-guide-section-accordion">
                        <div class="admin-guide-section-header" onclick="toggleAdminGuideSection('admin-tools')" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="admin-guide-section-admin-tools" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();toggleAdminGuideSection('admin-tools');}">
                            <span><i class="fa fa-tools"></i> Save, product list &amp; Excel</span>
                            <i id="admin-guide-section-icon-admin-tools" class="fa fa-chevron-down admin-guide-section-chevron"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div id="admin-guide-section-admin-tools" class="admin-guide-section-content" style="display:none;">
                            <p><strong>Save:</strong> Progress bar shows upload % and extraction %. Unsaved changes prompt if you cancel.</p>
                            <p><strong>Product list:</strong> Search name, price, category, ID. Filter dropdown for stock, no variants, missing images/category, video, rotation, panorama.</p>
                            <p><strong>Admin screen:</strong> Categories accordion + Products list on top. Bulk Excel, promos, pagination (storefront + admin page size), and more under <strong>Store settings &amp; tools</strong> at the bottom.</p>
                            <p><strong>Excel:</strong> Store settings → Bulk Catalog Actions. Export includes VariantsJSON, videos, spin/panorama URLs, stock. Re-import with matching <strong>ID</strong> to update.</p>
                            <p><strong>CRUD:</strong> + NEW ITEM · pencil = edit · copy = duplicate (shares URLs until re-upload) · trash = delete with confirm.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="m-global-stock-container" style="margin-bottom:15px; padding:12px; background:#141414; border:1px solid rgba(255,179,71,0.25); border-radius:10px;">
                <p style="font-size:10px; color:#ffb347; margin:0 0 6px 0; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Level 1 · Product Global Stock <span style="color:#666; text-transform:none;">(optional)</span></p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 10px; font-size:10px; color:#777; line-height:1.4;">One quantity for the <strong>entire product</strong>. Every variant and combo uses this pool unless Level 2 or Level 3 is turned on below.</p>
                <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:12px;">
                    <label style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; cursor:pointer; margin:0;">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="m-track-global-stock" style="width:auto; margin:0;" onchange="toggleGlobalStockUI()">
                        <span style="font-size:12px; color:#ffb347; font-weight:600;">Track product-global stock</span>
                    </label>
                    <div id="m-global-stock-qty-wrap" style="display:none; flex:1; min-width:160px; align-items:center; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
                        <input type="number" id="m-global-stock-qty" min="0" placeholder="0" style="width:100px; padding:6px 8px; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid #444; background:#222; color:#FFD700; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; text-align:center;">
                        <span style="font-size:10px; color:#666;">units for whole product (fallback when variant levels are off)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p style="font-size:10px; color:#666; margin-bottom:5px; text-transform: uppercase;">Product Variants</p>
            <div id="m-variants-container"
                style="background:#121212; border: 1px solid #282828; border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
            </div>
            <button onclick="addVariantBlock()"
                style="width:100%; padding:10px; background:#222; color:#fff; border:1px dashed #555; border-radius:8px; cursor:pointer; font-size:12px; margin-bottom: 15px;">+
